    <string name="cmd_time">The node time (shown here; by voice *)</string>
    <string name="cmd_id">The node sends its ID (callsign) *</string>
    <string name="quick_commands_note">Tap a command to put it on the display, add the node number if needed and press Send. These are the standard ASL3 codes; your node may have others. EchoLink nodes are 3 + their number (EL 677857 → 3677857).\n* You only hear the answer if voice telemetry is on in your node (rpt.conf: telemdefault = 1). Many hubs and nodes bridged to digital networks turn it off.</string>
